    "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/guide.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727#download-updater\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-updater.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Get it on Updater CE - with guided install\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### Downloads\n\n**G5 \u00b7 Stock**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=windows&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows for G5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=windows-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-windows-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Windows 7 for G5 \u00b7 Stock - XP/7/8.1 \u00b7 SP Flash Tool guide\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=linux&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux for G5 \u00b7 Stock - x86-64 \u00b7 portable package\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom&amp;tag=MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727&amp;asset=rom_g5.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fg5-stock-rom-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/g5-stock-rom-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for 32-bit Linux for G5 \u00b7 Stock - pre-AppImage \u00b7 SP Flash Tool\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\nOriginal Innioasis G5 software **MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727**.\n\n- Model: **G5** (Innioasis)\n- Package: `rom_g5.zip`\n- Build tag: `MX4_EN-V1.11-20260727`\n- Build date: 2026-07-27\n\n## Install\n\n1. Download `rom_g5.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_g5.zip.* > rom_g5.zip`).\n2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.\n3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.\n4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: <https://innioasis.app/guide.html>\n\nThis wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| `rom_g5.zip` | 1953.7 MB |\n| `SHA256SUMS` | 0.0 MB |\n\nFull archive: <https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?model=G5>\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"G5\",\"name\":\"rom_g5-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"636f3e3491fd43b769a292af179781cac2ef7c536a6f78e2951d93aabd60794e\",\"size\":2088208244,\"source_asset\":\"rom_g5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"G5\",\"name\":\"rom_g5-windows-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"b5d15fffdd71f0ccdf5c75a6fcc82a0044c388eeebc10c53e0c136ae6242b83d\",\"size\":2097668626,\"source_asset\":\"rom_g5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"G5\",\"name\":\"rom_g5-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"374eda4c777d00803612f2dc40ed6ae5a8621aac52947dab6f8cfe8fd497a9e6\",\"size\":2096082089,\"source_asset\":\"rom_g5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"},{\"model\":\"G5\",\"name\":\"rom_g5-linux-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"dc8a38ce84e23c5d199ebfbca3ad4c81fe4eaa81d94e366ea6ba3802b1804d8c\",\"size\":2096082911,\"source_asset\":\"rom_g5.zip\",\"type\":\"Stock\"}],\"built_at\":\"20